@baseUrl = http://localhost:5088

### Get students
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/student

### Get student
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/student/1

### Create student
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/student
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Thandi",
  "lastName": "Nkosi",
  "email": "thandi@example.com"
}

### Update student
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/student/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Thandi",
  "lastName": "Nkosi-Dlamini",
  "email": "thandi@example.com"
}

### Delete student
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/student/1

